# ArduCopter SITL parameters for nav_source:=sim, loaded by gazebo_sim.launch.py after
# ArduPilot's stock copter.parm and gazebo-iris.parm (Tools/autotest/default_params at
# Copter-4.7.2, fb773567). Neither stock file touches ARMING_CHECK, so every pre-arm
# check stays at its default here too.

# The drone's MAVROS loads no stream-rate config, so SITL sets the IMU rate the Pi sees:
# RAW_IMU and SCALED_IMU at 50 Hz on the MAVROS link (SERIAL0, tcp:5760). ArduPilot 4.7
# names SERIAL0's stream rates MAV1_*; it ignores the older SR0_* names in a defaults file,
# which left every stream at 0 and MAVROS with nothing but the heartbeat.
MAV1_RAW_SENS 50
# Copter defaults every other stream to 0, and nothing here requests streams (no
# MAVProxy), so without these MAVROS never gets LOCAL_POSITION_NED or ATTITUDE and
# /mavros/local_position/odom stays silent.
MAV1_POSITION 10
MAV1_EXTRA1 10
MAV1_EXT_STAT 2

# Nothing in the simulation flies a radio, but SITL still feeds a default RC input. The
# first settled read of the flight-mode channel set a mode from stock copter.parm's FLTMODE
# table and replaced the flight starter's GUIDED request with STABILIZE, so the drone armed
# in STABILIZE and refused takeoff. With the channel disabled only MAVLink sets the mode.
FLTMODE_CH 0

# Source set 1 navigates on GPS alone: GPS horizontal position and velocity, barometer
# height, GPS vertical velocity, compass yaw.
EK3_SRC1_POSXY 3
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 3
EK3_SRC1_POSZ 1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ 3
EK3_SRC1_YAW 1
